name: assess
description: Judge whether a link or item someone sends (a repo, paper, post, product page or idea) is useful here, whether its claims hold, and what to do next. Use when asked "is this useful?", "should we use/buy this?", "does this apply to us?", or when another agent forwards a link for evaluation.
